  "releaseNotes": "Fixed driver & transport-layer defects: atomic request-response, concurrency safety, timeout handling and resource cleanup in SocketTransport/IoTSocketDriver/IoTHttpDriver; adopt shared DriverCodec.  修复网络驱动与传输层缺陷：请求-响应原子化、并发安全、超时处理与资源清理，使用共享DriverCodec编解码。",
